MODULE: DeadlineBoundedRetainsExpiredWait
TARGET: DeadlineBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: deadline observation reaches zero without settling the client
PERTURBS: ClientDeadline

--- FIND
    /\ clientActive' = [clientActive EXCEPT ![r] = deadline'[r] > 0]
--- REPLACE
    /\ clientActive' = clientActive
--- END
